(6843121, 1029491, 23394, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  simply awesome.  you should print this as large as you can afford to and hang it where you can see it as much as possible.  what a perfect tonic for a rough day.</td>', 'AWESOME!  simply awesome.  you should print this as large as you can afford to and hang it where you can see it as much as possible.  what a perfect tonic for a rough day.', '2012-08-16 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
