(6843126, 1029394, 23394, '<td valign="top">she''s a cutie, but i don''t think you''re going to get many points from the typical dpc voter.  part of it is image quality, part of it is processing.  if you look through the portrait galleries here on the site, you can probably find some good examples of the type of image you''d like to capture, as well as some pointers on how best to do it, especially in terms of controlling your lighting.</td>', 'she''s a cutie, but i don''t think you''re going to get many points from the typical dpc voter.  part of it is image quality, part of it is processing.  if you look through the portrait galleries here on the site, you can probably find some good examples of the type of image you''d like to capture, as well as some pointers on how best to do it, especially in terms of controlling your lighting.', '2012-08-16 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
