(6844007, 1029461, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the wind blown look for it projects a carefree mood -a perfect compliment to childhood. A very lovely portrait of this little girl.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the wind blown look for it projects a carefree mood -a perfect compliment to childhood. A very lovely portrait of this little girl.', '2012-08-18 10:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844009, 1029489, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great catch lights that add a twinkle to her eyes to match that merry smile. Love the title for it compliments this portrait of this happy girl. Love the lighting for we see all the great details of her face (the balance of light and shadows are perfect). Well done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great catch lights that add a twinkle to her eyes to match that merry smile. Love the title for it compliments this portrait of this happy girl. Love the lighting for we see all the great details of her face (the balance of light and shadows are perfect). Well done.', '2012-08-18 10:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844017, 1029493, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>He has a great smile! I wish you showed us more of his winning smile by zooming/cropping closer to his face. There is just a little too much background that dominates the scene. A square crop that would end just bellow the shoulders and just above the head would truly allow that cheek to cheek smile to shine. B&amp;W would also help this portrait shine even more because the color clash of the muted orange of the shirt against the forest greens of the backdrop draw attention away from your main focus.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. He has a great smile! I wish you showed us more of his winning smile by zooming/cropping closer to his face. There is just a little too much background that dominates the scene. A square crop that would end just bellow the shoulders and just above the head would truly allow that cheek to cheek smile to shine. B&W would also help this portrait shine even more because the color clash of the muted orange of the shirt against the forest greens of the backdrop draw attention away from your main focus.', '2012-08-18 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844020, 1029484, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment now after bumping this up a notch.<br/> <br/>What really makes the shot is that brilliant smile shining from under the brim of the cowboy hat. The pose with his arms/hands are wrapped around his chest/belly makes me think he is reacting to something he found very funny which just adds to the mood of the shot. I do have one critique and that is I wish that the lighting was more even. There are blown highlights on the right side of this Vaquero that extends to portions of his sleeves on the folded arms.</td>', 'Coming back to comment now after bumping this up a notch. What really makes the shot is that brilliant smile shining from under the brim of the cowboy hat. The pose with his arms/hands are wrapped around his chest/belly makes me think he is reacting to something he found very funny which just adds to the mood of the shot. I do have one critique and that is I wish that the lighting was more even. There are blown highlights on the right side of this Vaquero that extends to portions of his sleeves on the folded arms.', '2012-08-18 10:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
