(6844183, 1029544, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love the idea of putting the photographer out front as the main subject for the portrait shot:-) The outdoor natural lighting is very good on the main subject. I wonder if that wide happy smile means she has just captured a winning photo herself:-) I do have a small critique in that I wish there was a tighter crop on the main subject to further minimize the greenery of the backdrop (of course that means a smaller lens on her camera in order to fit in the frame).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love the idea of putting the photographer out front as the main subject for the portrait shot:-) The outdoor natural lighting is very good on the main subject. I wonder if that wide happy smile means she has just captured a winning photo herself:-) I do have a small critique in that I wish there was a tighter crop on the main subject to further minimize the greenery of the backdrop (of course that means a smaller lens on her camera in order to fit in the frame).', '2012-08-18 23:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
