(6844666, 1029245, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like the high key style. Works well in this challenge to accentuate the smile. Good focus on her smile and her eyes. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Like the high key style. Works well in this challenge to accentuate the smile. Good focus on her smile and her eyes. One of my top picks.', '2012-08-19 23:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844667, 1029296, 103032, '<td valign="top">Crop works well for the challenge.  Good focus on he smile.  Looks like a very honest smile, not posed.  A top pick for me.</td>', 'Crop works well for the challenge.  Good focus on he smile.  Looks like a very honest smile, not posed.  A top pick for me.', '2012-08-20 00:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844668, 1029418, 103032, '<td valign="top">A heck of a character study. I see more of a smile in his eyes than his mouth if that makes sense. Great portrait.</td>', 'A heck of a character study. I see more of a smile in his eyes than his mouth if that makes sense. Great portrait.', '2012-08-20 00:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844669, 1029132, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a little cutie! You captured a nice smile and lovely twinkle in her eyes. Processing has a nice dynamic tonal range that is well balanced. Nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a little cutie! You captured a nice smile and lovely twinkle in her eyes. Processing has a nice dynamic tonal range that is well balanced. Nicely done.', '2012-08-20 00:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844671, 1029547, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The biggest thing that draws me into this portrait is the happy sparkle in the eyes. I wish the guards on the helmet did not block so much of smile of his lips. Nonetheless, I still get the visual of a big ol''smile from his cheeks.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The biggest thing that draws me into this portrait is the happy sparkle in the eyes. I wish the guards on the helmet did not block so much of smile of his lips. Nonetheless, I still get the visual of a big ol''smile from his cheeks.', '2012-08-20 00:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844676, 1029491, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a great laughing happy smile. There is pure joy in her expression - nothing staged. Now I do have two small critiques that I believe would turn a good shot into a great shot. Bring us closer to the main subject by cropping/zooming in more on the little girl. There is just a bit too much background to let her joyous expression fill the frame and become the dominent focal point. My final critique is on how the title can compliment the photo (oh, man, she is getting nitpicky now). I don''t get the sense that this little girl is camping. I <u>did not </u>deduct points but I simply want to point out that "show, don''t tell" is a good rule of thumb. The background with what looks like sheep and the rolling hills that are separated into plots invokes more of the idea of a visit to a farm.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a great laughing happy smile. There is pure joy in her expression - nothing staged. Now I do have two small critiques that I believe would turn a good shot into a great shot. Bring us closer to the main subject by cropping/zooming in more on the little girl. There is just a bit too much background to let her joyous expression fill the frame and become the dominent focal point. My final critique is on how the title can compliment the photo (oh, man, she is getting nitpicky now). I don''t get the sense that this little girl is camping. I did not deduct points but I simply want to point out that "show, don''t tell" is a good rule of thumb. The background with what looks like sheep and the rolling hills that are separated into plots invokes more of the idea of a visit to a farm.', '2012-08-20 00:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6844677, 1029007, 74588, '<td valign="top">very dreamy   10</td>', 'very dreamy   10', '2012-08-20 00:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
