(6844716, 1029372, 40391, '<td valign="top">I feel terrible!  Even though I gave this a 7 I had meant to come back and have a closer look to ensure that it wasnt a photo of a painting (as I had originally thought but wanted to be sure) and boost my score accordingly.  This would have been (and should have been) a 10 from me.  Wonderfully done and it should have ribboned.</td>', 'I feel terrible!  Even though I gave this a 7 I had meant to come back and have a closer look to ensure that it wasnt a photo of a painting (as I had originally thought but wanted to be sure) and boost my score accordingly.  This would have been (and should have been) a 10 from me.  Wonderfully done and it should have ribboned.', '2012-08-20 01:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
