(6844769, 1029268, 112828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MattO:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cory:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought that was your boy I saw on the cards at Walgreens... Meant to ask.  I assume it was indeed him? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s possible, he has been in a few MDA things before. All of them photographed by me. This one hasn''t been used yet except to make this banner <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1030411" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/45524/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1030411.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/45524/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1030411.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/45524/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1030411.jpg"/></a> that will be used next weekend by the local dept. during the Fill the Boot Campaign. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Color me impressed! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by MattO: Originally posted by Cory: I thought that was your boy I saw on the cards at Walgreens... Meant to ask.  I assume it was indeed him?   It''s possible, he has been in a few MDA things before. All of them photographed by me. This one hasn''t been used yet except to make this banner  that will be used next weekend by the local dept. during the Fill the Boot Campaign.   Color me impressed! :)', '2012-08-20 01:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
