(6845017, 1029296, 117474, '<td valign="top">Your old man sort of looks like Walter white from the TV show breaking bad.<br/> <br/>Great image. Great notes too! ''Grats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Your old man sort of looks like Walter white from the TV show breaking bad. Great image. Great notes too! ''Grats on the ribbon!', '2012-08-20 07:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845024, 1029461, 5822, '<td valign="top">Quite a compelling portrait that really shows off your excellent photography skills. The glamour processing is beautiful except for her eyes, and only the whites at that, which seem overdone a bit. Her irises are lovely and you bring out nice detail in them. The softness is fine for a subject of this age, imo, and I love how her hair fans out in the square format. Little girl grows up early seems to be the story and you brought it out in her well.</td>', 'Quite a compelling portrait that really shows off your excellent photography skills. The glamour processing is beautiful except for her eyes, and only the whites at that, which seem overdone a bit. Her irises are lovely and you bring out nice detail in them. The softness is fine for a subject of this age, imo, and I love how her hair fans out in the square format. Little girl grows up early seems to be the story and you brought it out in her well.', '2012-08-20 08:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845052, 1029418, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alexkc:</b></div><hr/><i> No doubt it will get the blue! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was right :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on your new PB John!</td>', 'Originally posted by Alexkc: No doubt it will get the blue!   I was right :) Congrats on your new PB John!', '2012-08-20 09:00:04.000000', NULL, 0),
