(6845286, 1029418, 30982, '<td valign="top">You are so very good at capturing the essence of people in that little box you carry.  This is wonderful!</td>', 'You are so very good at capturing the essence of people in that little box you carry.  This is wonderful!', '2012-08-20 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845299, 1029276, 28742, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6 because that smile overcomes all the technical flaws: unflatteringly soft, gray tones look somewhat posterized/blotchy, crop is a bit tight for my liking. But still, I would hang it in my office if he were my kid. :)</td>', 'I gave it a 6 because that smile overcomes all the technical flaws: unflatteringly soft, gray tones look somewhat posterized/blotchy, crop is a bit tight for my liking. But still, I would hang it in my office if he were my kid. :)', '2012-08-20 16:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845302, 1029276, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see some detail in the skin and especially the eyes.  The odd processing on the neck, ear, and hair put me off a bit.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see the original of this to see if it''s the processing that caused you to score so low with such an adorable kid''s smile going for it.</td>', 'I''d prefer to see some detail in the skin and especially the eyes.  The odd processing on the neck, ear, and hair put me off a bit. I''d love to see the original of this to see if it''s the processing that caused you to score so low with such an adorable kid''s smile going for it.', '2012-08-20 16:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845304, 1029418, 19825, '<td valign="top">You have certainly captured him well. Thanks for the lesson in street portraiture, and congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'You have certainly captured him well. Thanks for the lesson in street portraiture, and congrats on the ribbon.', '2012-08-20 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845308, 1029276, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great pose by the model and very good interaction between the photographer and the child. Technical problems show throughout the photo include high noise grain, lots of digital artifacting convering the photo particularly on the grey shadow line on the hairline and down the neck, somewhat blown highlights on the cheek.</td>', 'Great pose by the model and very good interaction between the photographer and the child. Technical problems show throughout the photo include high noise grain, lots of digital artifacting convering the photo particularly on the grey shadow line on the hairline and down the neck, somewhat blown highlights on the cheek.', '2012-08-20 16:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845314, 1029445, 117474, '<td valign="top">Bloody great image!</td>', 'Bloody great image!', '2012-08-20 16:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6845326, 1029276, 113900, '<td valign="top">The model is cute.  The pose is natural and it makes you happy just to look at him.  But, in terms of DPC I think this would have done better as just a straight B&amp;W with little processing or maybe even in color.  <br/> <br/>The problem lies in the processing.   Try a re-edit from the original and post it.   I think it would be much better recieved.  <br/> <br/>Cute kid, you should be proud.</td>', 'The model is cute.  The pose is natural and it makes you happy just to look at him.  But, in terms of DPC I think this would have done better as just a straight B&W with little processing or maybe even in color.   The problem lies in the processing.   Try a re-edit from the original and post it.   I think it would be much better recieved.   Cute kid, you should be proud.', '2012-08-20 16:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
