(6846077, 1029372, 30214, '<td valign="top">amazing is the word. Where on Earth have you found the second Mona Lisa?! And shot her so convincingly?! The face is just perfect. The hands, indeed, you could try to make them look smaller by a different choice of lens or POV. Anyway, it does not have to be an exact replica.... overall, fantastic job!</td>', 'amazing is the word. Where on Earth have you found the second Mona Lisa?! And shot her so convincingly?! The face is just perfect. The hands, indeed, you could try to make them look smaller by a different choice of lens or POV. Anyway, it does not have to be an exact replica.... overall, fantastic job!', '2012-08-21 21:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
