(6846114, 1029394, 74948, '<td valign="top">I know I wasn''t gonna get a lot of high votes; but you know it''s really hard to catch a 1 yr old sitting still, unless they are sleeping. I was really lucky to actually snap this picture, sadly the lighting was just your normal amber bulb so had to use my flash just so I can catch a NON blurry picture. I still love this picture even if everyone else thinks it crap, none the less it''s a REALLY good shot of her beautiful eyes.</td>', 'I know I wasn''t gonna get a lot of high votes; but you know it''s really hard to catch a 1 yr old sitting still, unless they are sleeping. I was really lucky to actually snap this picture, sadly the lighting was just your normal amber bulb so had to use my flash just so I can catch a NON blurry picture. I still love this picture even if everyone else thinks it crap, none the less it''s a REALLY good shot of her beautiful eyes.', '2012-08-21 22:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
