(6847596, 1029484, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FtWorthphotog:</b></div><hr/><i> While he was shooting six inches from some other cowboys face I happened to turn around and catch this guy laughing at his partner being photographed.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh, and I''m glad I could contribute to your ribbon in some way. I couldn''t make your kid smile, though. You''ll get my bill shortly.</td>', 'Originally posted by FtWorthphotog: While he was shooting six inches from some other cowboys face I happened to turn around and catch this guy laughing at his partner being photographed. Oh, and I''m glad I could contribute to your ribbon in some way. I couldn''t make your kid smile, though. You''ll get my bill shortly.', '2012-08-24 00:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6847665, 1029552, 143098, '<td valign="top">Monica, <br/> <br/>I know we have never been formally introduced ..(I''m Josh).  I wanted to take a second before I started basking in the glow of my first ribbon to come by and tell you that I think it is complete crap about your DQ.  I hate that your shot was DQ''d on such a trivial little thing as a future date.  I felt letting you know how I felt was the proper thing to do and wanted you to know that I take no pleasure in benefiting from your loss.  BTW like your blog and that smile was really great. Good luck in the future and hope to see you back on the front page again soon.<br/> <br/>-Josh</td>', 'Monica,  I know we have never been formally introduced ..(I''m Josh).  I wanted to take a second before I started basking in the glow of my first ribbon to come by and tell you that I think it is complete crap about your DQ.  I hate that your shot was DQ''d on such a trivial little thing as a future date.  I felt letting you know how I felt was the proper thing to do and wanted you to know that I take no pleasure in benefiting from your loss.  BTW like your blog and that smile was really great. Good luck in the future and hope to see you back on the front page again soon. -Josh', '2012-08-24 02:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
