(6851607, 1029491, 12611, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> the background is beautiful and suggestive. a photo needs background or else it becomes too simple and forgettable. a crop would only hurt this photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the man is correct. There is such wonderful exuberance in the expression, and then the second layer, a pastoral background feel bringing the viewer, or at least me, to an age of farming and a simpler life. For that, the shot its one of the best in the challenge in my eyes.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: the background is beautiful and suggestive. a photo needs background or else it becomes too simple and forgettable. a crop would only hurt this photo.   the man is correct. There is such wonderful exuberance in the expression, and then the second layer, a pastoral background feel bringing the viewer, or at least me, to an age of farming and a simpler life. For that, the shot its one of the best in the challenge in my eyes.', '2012-08-29 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 0),
